# Store safety supplies

::: cards Keep daily supplies within reach {layout=masonry columns=2}
:: Gloves
Keep clean gloves near the tasks that require them. Replace torn pairs before work begins.

:: Spill kit
Check the seal after each use. Restock absorbent pads before the next shift.
:::

::: cards Check supplies by task {layout=rows}
:: Before cleaning
Check the label and select the required gloves.

:: Before maintenance
Find the lockout kit and confirm every tag is legible.
:::
